# Project Overview

This repository is the **lightwell** Cursor plugin (shareable AI skills) for
upgrading Red Hat Lightwell Maven projects. It is not a Maven playground and
not a clone-to-consume project skill.

Skills live under `plugins/lightwell/skills/`. They run against a **consumer**
workspace that has `pom.xml`. This plugin repo has no application `pom.xml`.
